// Rule: [T1098.007] Papercut Agentic Campaign - Domain Admins Membership Addition
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1098.007
// Classification: Production candidate
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Sentinel / Log Analytics
// Required telemetry: SecurityEvent
// Purpose: Detects an account being added to the Domain Admins global group by filtering its stable RID 512. Every result requires approved-change validation.
// Logic: Evaluate SecurityEvent for domain admins membership addition using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: A result is a privileged group change; validate it against the approved change record.
// A match does not prove: successful exploitation, malicious ownership, downstream impact, campaign attribution or complete compromise without corroborating evidence.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// PaperCut campaign - account added to Domain Admins
// Status: Production candidate - Untested implementation sketch
// Confidence: Medium
// Primary platform: Microsoft Sentinel / Log Analytics
// Required connector: Windows Security Events via AMA
// Required audit policy: Audit Security Group Management on domain controllers
// Evidence: GreyNoise observed an adversary-created account being added to Domain Admins.
// RID 512 identifies the Domain Admins global group in every AD domain.
// This query has no threshold, aggregation, sequence, or join.
// A result is a privileged group change; validate it against the approved change record.

SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 4728
| where TargetSid endswith "-512"
| project
    TimeGenerated,
    Computer,
    EventID,
    Activity,
    SubjectAccount,
    SubjectUserSid,
    SubjectLogonId,
    TargetAccount,
    TargetDomainName,
    TargetSid,
    MemberName,
    MemberSid
| order by TimeGenerated desc
